body_text:
Only DOUBLE arrays are supported, but casting to another array type fails with a message-less `UnsupportedOperationException` instead of an SQL error. REST answers HTTP 500 with an empty error; PG wire sends an empty `ERROR:`.

### To reproduce

```sql
SELECT CAST(x AS INT[]) FROM long_sequence(1);
```

Actual: `UnsupportedOperationException`, no message.
