I tried this code:

```rust
pub trait Example {
    fn test() -> impl Eq + Ord + Send;
}

impl Example for u8 {
    fn test() -> impl Eq + Ord {
        "example"
    }
}
```

I expected an error or at least a warning, but the code compiled with no diagnostics. Omitting ~~`Eq` or~~ `Ord` from the implementing function does produce an error.

